# Cutover is the point of no return; accepting a cancel there reports a cut-over tree as cancelled.
MODULE: NothingCutOverUnlessCompletedCancelAtCutover
TARGET: NothingCutOverUnlessCompleted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a cancel is accepted after the cutover swap
PERTURBS: DriveCancel

--- FIND
    /\ remInProgress /\ CancelAccepted(o)
    /\ remInProgress' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ remInProgress /\ (CancelAccepted(o) \/ (remOwner = opFollows[o] /\ remPhase = "Cutover"))
    /\ remInProgress' = FALSE
--- END
